    {
      "target": "동생은 오늘 엄마 역할을 해요.",
      "reading": "dongsaengeun oneul eomma yeokhareul haeyo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "My younger sibling is taking the mom role today.",
        "ko": "동생은 오늘 엄마 역할을 해요.",
        "ipa": "dongsaengeun oneul eomma yeokhareul haeyo.",
        "ar": "أخي الأصغر يلعب دور الأم اليوم.",
        "cs": "Můj mladší sourozenec dnes hraje roli maminky.",
        "da": "Min lillebror eller lillesøster har mor-rollen i dag.",
        "de": "Mein jüngerer Bruder übernimmt heute die Mutterrolle.",
